   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The passé composé",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about what you did, use the **passé composé**. It is formed with the present of **avoir** + the **past participle**: **J'ai mangé** (I ate, I have eaten).",
      "The past participle of -er verbs ends in **-é**: manger → **mangé**, regarder → **regardé**, travailler → **travaillé**. It sounds the same as the infinitive.",
      "In English too we distinguish «I ate» and «I have eaten»; in French, the passé composé covers both."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
