    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Irregular past participles and negation",
     "texto": [
      "The most used verbs have past participles that must be learned: faire → **fait**, prendre → **pris**, voir → **vu**, avoir → **eu**, être → **été**, lire → **lu**, boire → **bu**.",
      "The negation surrounds «avoir», not the participle: **Je n'ai pas mangé** (I haven't eaten).",
      "Past time words: **hier** (yesterday), **hier soir** (last night), **la semaine dernière** (last week)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
